#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A free IBM course on building a foundational understanding of quantum "
"computing, technology, and applications for business."
msgstr ""
"Bezplatný kurz IBM o budování základního porozumění kvantovému počítání, "
"technologiím a aplikacím pro podnikání."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Přehled"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Přehled {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-"
"foundations/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-"
"foundations/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Designed by IBM Quantum&reg; experts, this course covers the essentials of "
"quantum computing and applications for business. Learn about this new "
"computing paradigm, how it works, and its potential to address incredibly "
"complex business problems. Complete the course to earn your IBM Quantum "
"Business Foundations badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento kurz, navržený odborníky z IBM Quantum&reg;, pokrývá základy "
"kvantového počítání a aplikace pro podnikání. Dozvíš se o tomto novém "
"výpočetním paradigmatu, jak funguje a jaký má potenciál řešit neuvěřitelně "
"složité obchodní problémy. Dokonči kurz a získej svůj odznak IBM Quantum "
"Business Foundations.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Zkouška {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To earn your badge for Quantum business foundations, take the exam at "
"IBM&reg; Training linked below. This exam is intended to be taken after "
"reading the lessons in this course. Once you have passed the exam, you will "
"be notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pro získání odznaku za Quantum business foundations slož zkoušku na IBM&reg;"
" Training na odkazu níže. Tato zkouška je určena k absolvování po přečtení "
"lekcí v tomto kurzu. Jakmile zkoušku složíš, Credly tě upozorní, že jsi "
"získal/a odznak.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Exam](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations/exam)\n"
msgstr "[Zkouška](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations/exam)\n"

